{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":712319,"name":"Flam","username":"Flam-264001","avatar_template":"/en/wow/plugins/discourse-blizzard-plugin/images/avatars/wow/default.png","created_at":"2019-06-29T00:16:53.569Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eAnyone observed anything like this before? Seems really odd to me and I can’t think of a single thing to cause it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe weather effect was Sandstorm. My TCS vs their Anub Idol, last man standing on each team.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e[00:57:44] [Pet Battle]: Round 24\u003cbr\u003e\n[00:57:45] [Pet Battle]: [Phase Shift] applied [Dodge] to your Twilight Clutch-Sister.\u003cbr\u003e\n[00:57:47] [Pet Battle]: [Crush] was dodged by your Twilight Clutch-Sister.\u003cbr\u003e\n[00:57:49] [Pet Battle]: Round 25\u003cbr\u003e\n[00:57:50] [Pet Battle]: [Twilight Fire] dealt 157 damage to enemy Anubisath Idol.\u003cbr\u003e\n[00:57:50] [Pet Battle]: [Twilight Fire] applied [Twilight Flame] to enemy Anubisath Idol.\u003cbr\u003e\n[00:57:53] [Pet Battle]: [Crush] was dodged by your Twilight Clutch-Sister.\u003cbr\u003e\n[00:57:54] [Pet Battle]: [Twilight Flame] dealt 34 damage to enemy Anubisath Idol.\u003cbr\u003e\n[00:57:54] [Pet Battle]: [Dodge] fades from your Twilight Clutch-Sister.\u003cbr\u003e\n[00:57:54] [Pet Battle]:  applied [Dragonkin] to your Twilight Clutch-Sister.\u003cbr\u003e\n[00:57:55] [Pet Battle]: Round 26\u003cbr\u003e\n[00:57:56] [Pet Battle]: [Twilight Meteorite] dealt 468 damage to enemy Anubisath Idol.\u003cbr\u003e\n[00:57:58] [Pet Battle]: [Crush] dealt 325 damage to your Twilight Clutch-Sister (Strong).\u003cbr\u003e\n[00:57:58] [Pet Battle]: Your Twilight Clutch-Sister died.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBy the last round I was on \u0026lt;50hp and his Idol was under 700. For some reason my Dragonkin racial Twilight Meteorite hit for 468…\u003cbr\u003e\nBy my maths it should be 772+50%(racial) so 1158.\u003cbr\u003e\n1158 - 74 for weather effect so 1084.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI considered maybe if the weather effect was somehow tripled because Meteorite can hit 3 targets that would be 772-74-74-74 = 550, even without taking into account my Dragonkin racial being active.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThere were no other unmentioned damage modifiers or buffs at play.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAbsolute headscratcher.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-04-22T04:05:51.304Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":24,"reads":15,"readers_count":14,"score":128.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":58904,"topic_slug":"sandstorm-twilight-meteorite-bug","display_username":"Flam","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":264001,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":"Ownership transferred","can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"user_custom_fields":{"profile_url":"https://worldofwarcraft.com/en-gb/character/eu/ravencrest/lanadrah/","race":"Night Elf","class":"Demon Hunter","player_class_enum":"DEMONHUNTER","blizzard_post_count":"5","guild":"Speedyboi","level":"45","achievement_points":"53070"},"post_url":"/t/sandstorm-twilight-meteorite-bug/58904/1","alias_avatar":"https://render.worldofwarcraft.com/eu/character/ravencrest/42/110345258-avatar.jpg?alt=/wow/static/images/2d/avatar/29-1.jpg","alias_username":"Flamm-ravencrest","poster_alias":{"alias":{"name":"Flamm-ravencrest","avatar":"https://render.worldofwarcraft.com/eu/character/ravencrest/42/110345258-avatar.jpg?alt=/wow/static/images/2d/avatar/29-1.jpg","url":"https://worldofwarcraft.com/en-gb/character/eu/ravencrest/flamm/","user_id":264001,"id":8